  "description": "The CAPRA CORE 2 CF is where things get serious, and this bike is ready to handle anything you can throw at it. Powered by our race-ready carbon frame, it's rapid on the racetrack, playful at the jumps, and ready to brawl with the wildest trails on the planet. Its spec is bulletproof and all about keeping you on the trails and out of the workshop: RockShox provides suspension, Shimano is on the shifting, and with the powerful combination of TRP DH-R EVO brakes and Continental tires, you're always one step ahead of the terrain. It's your call. We offer the CAPRA CORE 2 in aluminum or high-modulus carbon fiber, so you'll always get the frame you want – choose carbon for a performance edge, or aluminum for that FULL METAL feeling.",
